{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（14日）下午1時25分，警方接報將軍澳影業路與集福路交界一處工地，有工人跌落逾1米下位置。傷者清醒，惟未能返回地面。</p><p>救援人員到場救起67歲姓溫傷者，他手腳擦傷並感頸痛，隨後由救護車送往伊利沙伯醫院救治。警方經初步調查，相信他離開挖泥車時，意外跌入深約1.2米的坑內。</p><figure><img alt=\"傷者由救護車送院。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260714/1153701455463452672097638.jpeg/gyxRE2PFUZONppdxmRR_7rn4NshqFqq-1tjPytbYz8o\"/><figcaption>傷者由救護車送院。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><p>現場所見，是影業路與集福路一段馬路工地，放有挖泥車，並已挖出一個深坑。</p><figure><img alt=\"警方在場調查。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260714/1153700441939251200079148.jpeg/4JMzMnzOhh73E6dRrFcIoSACdVWbaFp8e--pCVHvqQk\"/><figcaption>警方在場調查。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在場調查。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260714/1153700444904755200564019.jpeg/7AIROWfuQ1sbQJQHO873IdZXzGkELM_myR7vdOMe73Q\"/><figcaption>警方在場調查。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是一處工地。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260714/1153700447777984512895740.jpeg/NezHAmz58AKf37ElF4cbm9rCF7Wd6NWD4vcqEMj3KhA\"/><figcaption>現場是一處工地。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是一處工地。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260714/1153700450806403072378104.jpeg/-acqtmSM97faeFMtPkVP3yfP21UGnoeHzxUWuuUVFro\"/><figcaption>現場是一處工地。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是一處工地。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260714/1153700453646077952701352.jpeg/ZTO6Bjw8-LUP3gLD8EBRQLtO128XN2dbQSP2p2sj9qc\"/><figcaption>現場是一處工地。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"傷者被送到伊利沙伯醫院治理。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260714/1153715830668660736498635.jpeg/Um9N2w2WxqSKrR6s1G2q_AoYMJVkaro-JRM5FSUTORU\"/><figcaption>傷者被送到伊利沙伯醫院治理。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-14T07:40:21.251271+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":277,"images":7,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}